  "texts": {
    "briefing": "Capture The Flag\n----------------\n\nThe idea with this map is that Player 2 has a\nvery fast tank, but with almost no firepower.\nPlayer 1 has all the firepower, but is very\nslow. The powerful tank has to defend the\nflag, and the weak tank has to race around\nand try to steal it.\n\nHint : Player 2 can use the teleport in a\ncritical situation.\n\nRecommended Playing :\n\nPLAYER 1 : Everything but the mouse.\nPLAYER 2 : Mouse.\n\nMade by : Simon Pedersen (96h334@mail.novehs.dk)"
  },
